          "bbox": [
            124,
            499,
            482,
            514
          ],
          "page_idx": 4
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "公共场所室内空气中的臭氧、总挥发性有机物、氢浓度宜达到表3的要求。",
          "bbox": [
            157,
            526,
            694,
            542
          ],
          "page_idx": 4
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "表3公共场所室内空气中的臭氧、总挥发性有机物、氢卫生要求",
          "text_level": 1,
          "bbox": [
            260,
            552,
            734,
            569
          ],
          "page_idx": 4
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "img_path": "http://100.100.33.62:30900/wdzszt-docparse-test/c6eddf13de43df13f056011d5968798c470017fa94d0240d47a15605d8b4bf79.jpg",
          "table_caption": [],
          "table_footnote": [],
          "table_body": "<table><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>指标</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>要求</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>臭氧/（mg/m）</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>≤0.16</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>总挥发性有机物/（mg/m）</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>≤0.60</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>氢/（Bq/m²）</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>≤400</td></tr></table>",
